1
00:00:01,694 --> 00:00:03,964
Suns Road

2
00:00:04,264 --> 00:00:07,794
Yomogi Kindergarten! Bazaar today!

3
00:00:08,134 --> 00:00:10,404
Come on over!

4
00:00:15,014 --> 00:00:16,304
Squish?

5
00:00:20,784 --> 00:00:24,084
Could you possibly be, Ioryogi-san?

6
00:00:24,284 --> 00:00:30,224
Who else do you know that looks like this?
Of course it's me!

7
00:00:30,394 --> 00:00:32,724
And would you please get your hand off of me!

8
00:00:32,724 --> 00:00:34,214
Oh, yes sir!

9
00:00:34,634 --> 00:00:37,864
Ko... ba...

10
00:00:41,604 --> 00:00:42,864
Ioryogi-san?

11
00:00:45,404 --> 00:00:46,774
Ioryogi-san!

12
00:00:47,144 --> 00:00:48,174
Yeah?

13
00:00:48,174 --> 00:00:50,514
Are you having a nap in the middle of the street?

14
00:00:50,844 --> 00:00:54,874
If you're sleepy, you should go
home and get into bed.

15
00:00:57,024 --> 00:00:59,754
I am not taking a nap!

16
00:01:04,694 --> 00:01:07,834
Kobato.

17
00:01:07,834 --> 00:01:10,664
Kobato.
What should I do?

18
00:01:10,664 --> 00:01:15,074
Kobato.
Even the most obvious of things

19
00:01:15,974 --> 00:01:19,274
Are always such a challenge

20
00:01:19,274 --> 00:01:22,044
I want to laugh when I'm happy

21
00:01:22,044 --> 00:01:26,344
And sing whenever I want

22
00:01:26,914 --> 00:01:29,354
Is all

23
00:01:30,654 --> 00:01:35,024
They say my dreams will come true someday

24
00:01:35,454 --> 00:01:38,724
But when will "someday" come?

25
00:01:38,724 --> 00:01:42,224
I can't wait forever

26
00:01:42,364 --> 00:01:48,134
On "1, 2, 3!" I'll spread open my arms

27
00:01:48,134 --> 00:01:53,344
And let the light gather around me

28
00:01:53,344 --> 00:01:56,174
Where is it?

29
00:01:56,174 --> 00:01:59,514
Please tell me what I can do

30
00:01:59,514 --> 00:02:02,354
I make the most of getting hurt

31
00:02:02,354 --> 00:02:05,254
And run with all my might

32
00:02:05,254 --> 00:02:09,224
Despite how many dozens of times I fall

33
00:02:09,224 --> 00:02:12,264
And start crying

34
00:02:12,264 --> 00:02:16,284
I surprise myself

35
00:02:16,764 --> 00:02:20,934
In how much I believe in tomorrow

36
00:02:30,544 --> 00:02:32,444
...Mysterious Life Form II.

37
00:02:32,444 --> 00:02:35,114
...Mysterious Life Form II.
What in the world is wrong, Ioryogi-san?

38
00:02:35,114 --> 00:02:36,284
...Mysterious Life Form II.
Don't you get it?!

39
00:02:36,284 --> 00:02:36,614
Don't you get it?!

40
00:02:37,184 --> 00:02:40,414
Does nothing seem wrong to
you about my appearance?!

41
00:02:40,724 --> 00:02:42,024
Huh?

42
00:02:42,524 --> 00:02:47,014
Um... well...

43
00:02:50,604 --> 00:02:53,264
Ioryogi-san, you are all covered in dirt!

44
00:02:55,034 --> 00:02:56,434
Figure it out!

45
00:02:57,504 --> 00:03:00,844
Anyway, just listen to me!

46
00:03:03,414 --> 00:03:05,474
Yomogi Kindergarten
Bazaar Hall

47
00:03:08,114 --> 00:03:10,314
Looks like heavy clouds today.

48
00:03:10,784 --> 00:03:11,914
It'll be all right!

49
00:03:12,954 --> 00:03:14,984
The clouds will clear, I'm sure.

50
00:03:15,494 --> 00:03:17,114
I certainly hope so.

51
00:03:21,134 --> 00:03:22,234
Ioryogi-san?

52
00:03:22,234 --> 00:03:25,424
I'll bring you something that will surely sell.

53
00:03:27,034 --> 00:03:28,764
Thank you very much!

54
00:03:29,534 --> 00:03:31,244
I said that but do I have something in mind?

55
00:03:31,244 --> 00:03:32,604
No.

56
00:03:32,804 --> 00:03:35,974
I'm just sick and tired of
sitting at the kindergarten

57
00:03:35,974 --> 00:03:37,244
pretending to be a stuffed doll all day long.

58
00:03:37,644 --> 00:03:41,674
I'm going to the bear's place and stuff
myself with some baumkuchen.

59
00:03:51,224 --> 00:03:53,694
Another odd place, as always.

60
00:03:58,904 --> 00:04:00,334
Bear's Baumkuchen Shop

61
00:04:00,334 --> 00:04:01,474
Bear's Baumkuchen Shop
One long!

62
00:04:01,474 --> 00:04:02,364
Bear's Baumkuchen Shop
You got it!

63
00:04:02,434 --> 00:04:04,004
Bear's Baumkuchen Shop
Come during our happy hour
Can I get four cuts please?

64
00:04:04,004 --> 00:04:05,174
Bear's Baumkuchen Shop
Come during our happy hour
Is my short ready yet?

65
00:04:05,174 --> 00:04:06,044
Bear's Baumkuchen Shop
Come during our happy hour
I'd like a half.

66
00:04:06,044 --> 00:04:06,374
I'd like a half.

67
00:04:06,374 --> 00:04:10,214
Yes, yes. The customer waiting for three
cuts? Thank you for waiting.

68
00:04:10,344 --> 00:04:11,584
Is mine ready yet?

69
00:04:11,584 --> 00:04:14,444
Please wait one more moment,
we're working on it!

70
00:04:14,584 --> 00:04:16,314
Six cuts, ready to go!

71
00:04:16,754 --> 00:04:18,344
How about the long order?

72
00:04:18,554 --> 00:04:19,624
Let me check on that.

73
00:04:19,624 --> 00:04:20,894
Two more minutes.

74
00:04:20,894 --> 00:04:22,794
You look busy.

75
00:04:23,054 --> 00:04:26,024
Hm? Yeah, well it was Zuisho's idea.

76
00:04:27,564 --> 00:04:29,324
A little ingenuity is important.

77
00:04:29,564 --> 00:04:33,034
Let's try more variations next time,
like adding chocolate.

78
00:04:33,034 --> 00:04:35,594
Not a bad idea. Bit by bit, yeah?

79
00:04:35,934 --> 00:04:37,904
You guys are right into this.

80
00:04:38,104 --> 00:04:42,564
At first I didn't know what to expect, but
I think we've got the hang of it now.

81
00:04:44,184 --> 00:04:46,444
Sarcasm doesn't get to you anymore does it?

82
00:04:46,444 --> 00:04:47,314
Huh?

83
00:04:47,314 --> 00:04:48,614
Nothing.

84
00:04:48,614 --> 00:04:52,214
Oh by the way, we've started
delivery service too!

85
00:04:56,894 --> 00:04:57,994
Here.

86
00:04:57,994 --> 00:05:00,254
Right. The Bear's Baumkuchen Shop.

87
00:05:00,664 --> 00:05:02,924
I've been waiting for you. Thanks.

88
00:05:03,134 --> 00:05:04,224
That's all right.

89
00:05:05,364 --> 00:05:07,924
You're not the regular bird. Are you new?

90
00:05:08,074 --> 00:05:09,334
No.

91
00:05:12,304 --> 00:05:13,964
Oh I see. You're a part timer.

92
00:05:14,414 --> 00:05:17,034
I used to do part time work myself.
I had a lot of jobs.

93
00:05:17,584 --> 00:05:20,814
There was one boss that wanted me to
do everything, it was impossible.

94
00:05:21,284 --> 00:05:23,614
You finished talking? Bye.

95
00:05:23,984 --> 00:05:25,354
Oh, by the way...

96
00:05:26,224 --> 00:05:28,494
I once had to go into this
mansion that was like a maze.

97
00:05:28,494 --> 00:05:31,894
It was a really strange place.
There were so many odd rooms.

98
00:05:31,964 --> 00:05:34,094
We're taking a break

99
00:05:34,094 --> 00:05:36,934
We're taking a break
You guys are so natural at this, I've completely
forgotten what you used to look like.

100
00:05:36,934 --> 00:05:40,964
You guys are so natural at this, I've completely
forgotten what you used to look like.

101
00:05:41,674 --> 00:05:43,364
I don't mind this body.

102
00:05:43,574 --> 00:05:48,104
Well the hairy part is a bit much, but if
you're careful, you can get used to it.

103
00:05:48,314 --> 00:05:55,214
Being acclimatized is a pretty scary thing.
I feel like I've been like this since I was born.

104
00:05:56,754 --> 00:06:01,124
You know it's hard to believe such
a thing ever happened.

105
00:06:01,924 --> 00:06:04,354
Yeah, to us it was like a bad dream.

106
00:06:04,864 --> 00:06:07,984
It certainly feels like a long, long time ago.

107
00:06:08,364 --> 00:06:09,694
It does.

108
00:06:09,934 --> 00:06:13,494
Think about it logically, we didn't have a chance.

109
00:06:13,734 --> 00:06:17,864
The opponent was just too powerful.
It was totally one sided.

110
00:06:18,074 --> 00:06:20,234
Once we started to crumble, the rest was quick.

111
00:06:21,014 --> 00:06:26,004
I sort of remember stomping on
someone then. I wonder who that was.

112
00:06:26,144 --> 00:06:27,204
That was me!

113
00:06:28,354 --> 00:06:32,484
Oh no! It was you?! I-I'm so sorry!

114
00:06:32,554 --> 00:06:33,984
It's over and done with.

115
00:06:34,224 --> 00:06:39,524
Besides, we weren't in any state of mind to be
getting angry about such things back then.

116
00:06:40,964 --> 00:06:42,724
Woah, don't you start!

117
00:06:43,194 --> 00:06:47,464
No matter how unsatisfied you may be...
after all, rules are rules.

118
00:06:50,804 --> 00:06:56,604
Right now all we can do is bake baumkuchen
cakes and wait for things to settle down.

119
00:06:57,444 --> 00:06:58,674
Right?

120
00:07:00,044 --> 00:07:02,044
We were so close that time.

121
00:07:03,054 --> 00:07:04,354
Hell with that!

122
00:07:04,354 --> 00:07:06,584
This is where you're supposed to repent.

123
00:07:06,824 --> 00:07:09,054
How can you say such a frightening thing?

124
00:07:09,054 --> 00:07:11,524
You must not even think that,
much less talk about it!

125
00:07:11,694 --> 00:07:17,894
He's right. If we poke at Tenkai again, we're not
going to get away with being bears and birds!

126
00:07:18,634 --> 00:07:22,624
I'll probably become a teddy bear and
this guy'll end up being bird feed!

127
00:07:22,804 --> 00:07:27,204
Oh, no! Not that! And that's not fair,
you getting the cute part!

128
00:07:27,344 --> 00:07:31,104
In any case, any trouble, no matter what
the reason, will not be tolerated!

129
00:07:31,384 --> 00:07:32,404
Do you understand?!

130
00:07:33,184 --> 00:07:34,444
Hey, wha?

131
00:07:38,384 --> 00:07:41,444
What do you think you're doing?
Don't go eating my merchandise!

132
00:07:45,494 --> 00:07:50,264
And he only gives me one box to take
with me. Such a stingy bear.

133
00:07:50,434 --> 00:07:51,604
Now...

134
00:07:51,604 --> 00:07:54,574
I've had something sweet to eat,
now I'd like something salty.

135
00:07:55,504 --> 00:07:59,904
Then after having something salty,
I'll have this baumkuchen cake.

136
00:08:01,414 --> 00:08:04,714
Where can I find something
salty? Maybe nowhere.

137
00:08:06,414 --> 00:08:11,114
How about something with soy sauce?
No, I'm in the mood for something salty.

138
00:08:14,794 --> 00:08:16,454
Now let me see...

139
00:08:16,754 --> 00:08:18,654
Something that'll hit me in the stomach...

140
00:08:26,904 --> 00:08:28,374
What are you doing?!

141
00:08:28,374 --> 00:08:29,864
Sorry, that was my fault.

142
00:08:30,374 --> 00:08:32,174
Huh? The ball came back.

143
00:08:32,474 --> 00:08:33,404
That's weird.

144
00:08:33,404 --> 00:08:34,744
Never mind.

145
00:08:35,244 --> 00:08:38,544
Darn kids! Are they all like that?

146
00:08:38,914 --> 00:08:41,614
What could be so fun about fiddling with a ball?

147
00:08:51,364 --> 00:08:53,024
What's this?!

148
00:08:55,064 --> 00:08:56,624
What in the world is going on?

149
00:08:58,834 --> 00:09:00,494
Hey quit that!

150
00:09:00,774 --> 00:09:02,634
I'm not something you'd want to eat!

151
00:09:04,644 --> 00:09:07,664
No! You can't have this! This is my snack!

152
00:09:07,814 --> 00:09:10,334
You're too young for baumkuchen cakes!

153
00:09:10,714 --> 00:09:13,514
If you don't cut that out,
I'll turn you into barbecue...

154
00:09:14,514 --> 00:09:15,714
Hey!

155
00:09:15,714 --> 00:09:18,844
Stop! Hey! Hey!

156
00:09:19,254 --> 00:09:27,394
Darn it! I will not... let go... of this box... if I
have to... put my life... on the... Woah!

157
00:09:27,594 --> 00:09:30,794
Oh, no!

158
00:09:33,264 --> 00:09:35,164
No, not water!

159
00:09:43,274 --> 00:09:46,004
Now this is tough...

160
00:09:51,984 --> 00:09:54,184
Ugh... I feel like I'm about to spit
out something other than fire.

161
00:10:10,644 --> 00:10:12,234
My body is so heavy...

162
00:10:21,954 --> 00:10:24,474
Man, when it rains, it pours, literally.

163
00:10:26,124 --> 00:10:28,114
Smiley Coin Laundry

164
00:10:33,064 --> 00:10:34,994
That'll dry me at once!

165
00:10:53,184 --> 00:10:56,344
Dryers are a lot harder on
the body than I expected.

166
00:10:56,884 --> 00:10:58,084
So...

167
00:10:58,284 --> 00:11:00,514
Where am I?

168
00:11:14,274 --> 00:11:15,374
Is that so?

169
00:11:15,374 --> 00:11:17,604
Yes! That grocery...

170
00:11:20,274 --> 00:11:23,244
In any case, I'm hungry.

171
00:11:28,354 --> 00:11:32,374
No, no, no, no, no. I'm going to get this
home and take my time enjoying it.

172
00:11:33,324 --> 00:11:38,024
It's not like I'm a kid on an errand that couldn't
help himself on the way home.

173
00:11:41,434 --> 00:11:42,924
No, no, no, no, no!

174
00:11:45,364 --> 00:11:47,964
Wh-What is this nice smell?

175
00:11:56,474 --> 00:11:59,104
And what is that mysterious life form?

176
00:12:15,364 --> 00:12:17,694
Welcome to, Mocona Land!

177
00:12:19,064 --> 00:12:22,234
All you little ladies and gentlemen!

178
00:12:22,234 --> 00:12:25,764
Don't get lost having too much fun, now!

179
00:12:26,204 --> 00:12:28,904
Well then, have lots of fun while you're here!

180
00:12:35,014 --> 00:12:37,504
Looks like I've wandered
into some bizarre place.

181
00:12:38,384 --> 00:12:41,484
Oh yes, that great smell.

182
00:12:49,494 --> 00:12:51,794
Everything looks so good!

183
00:12:52,864 --> 00:12:53,894
Woah?! Ow!

184
00:12:57,104 --> 00:13:00,374
Oww... Oh man, I've done it.

185
00:13:01,044 --> 00:13:02,514
I'm sorry about that!

186
00:13:05,284 --> 00:13:06,904
Huh? Hey wait!

187
00:13:12,824 --> 00:13:14,684
Please excuse me for that!

188
00:13:15,694 --> 00:13:20,394
Damn... I'm a stuffed animal but
I'm not a stuffed animal!

189
00:13:22,534 --> 00:13:24,504
I've got to get out of here fast.

190
00:13:24,504 --> 00:13:27,164
Somebody is going to steal
my baumkuchen box.

191
00:13:41,354 --> 00:13:43,644
Huh? What is this place?

192
00:13:43,984 --> 00:13:46,184
Huh? What's he doing?

193
00:13:46,424 --> 00:13:48,724
I'll get you anything you like.

194
00:13:48,724 --> 00:13:50,964
No, no it can't be. Could this be?!

195
00:13:50,964 --> 00:13:53,094
Daddy, get me that!

196
00:13:53,094 --> 00:13:54,284
Okay!

197
00:14:05,744 --> 00:14:07,304
Wh-Why this is...

198
00:14:07,304 --> 00:14:08,974
All right!

199
00:14:09,614 --> 00:14:12,414
A shooting range!

200
00:14:13,514 --> 00:14:14,774
Here you go!

201
00:14:14,914 --> 00:14:16,074
See what I got?

202
00:14:16,884 --> 00:14:20,024
Daddy, I want that blue puppy!

203
00:14:20,024 --> 00:14:20,954
Hm?

204
00:14:20,954 --> 00:14:22,854
Let me see...

205
00:14:22,954 --> 00:14:24,684
Where is it?

206
00:14:26,224 --> 00:14:27,494
That one, right?

207
00:14:28,894 --> 00:14:30,954
Why me?!

208
00:14:48,784 --> 00:14:49,754
Oh too bad!

209
00:14:49,754 --> 00:14:52,054
Aww, I missed it, did I?

210
00:14:54,124 --> 00:14:56,184
No, not "haw, haw, haw"!

211
00:14:57,354 --> 00:14:58,724
I'll get it this time!

212
00:15:01,194 --> 00:15:05,754
Oh no! It's coming straight at me!

213
00:15:08,274 --> 00:15:10,324
Aww, you missed again!

214
00:15:10,534 --> 00:15:11,904
So close!

215
00:15:11,904 --> 00:15:16,034
That's funny. Okay, this time for sure.

216
00:15:20,214 --> 00:15:22,284
Didn't it just move?

217
00:15:22,284 --> 00:15:25,314
Nothing moved, Daddy. You're just a lousy shot.

218
00:15:25,454 --> 00:15:30,324
Shucks. You just watch.
This sort of thing gets me going.

219
00:15:30,524 --> 00:15:31,894
Hang in there Daddy!

220
00:15:31,894 --> 00:15:34,234
Okay, now I'm getting it for sure!

221
00:15:34,234 --> 00:15:36,494
Let's see if you can get it this time.

222
00:15:36,864 --> 00:15:39,534
Damn! You're an adult, don't get so serious!

223
00:15:39,534 --> 00:15:40,904
Just give up will you?

224
00:15:44,504 --> 00:15:45,634
I almost got it!

225
00:15:46,874 --> 00:15:48,174
Let me try!

226
00:15:55,484 --> 00:15:57,074
We'll help you!

227
00:15:59,754 --> 00:16:01,274
Oh no!

228
00:16:06,394 --> 00:16:08,364
He's difficult to hit.

229
00:16:08,664 --> 00:16:10,724
Let me give it a try!

230
00:16:15,404 --> 00:16:17,974
In the olden days, people feared me.

231
00:16:17,974 --> 00:16:20,774
They used to call me "target shooter Kana."

232
00:16:29,254 --> 00:16:31,774
Now who on earth are you?!

233
00:16:42,334 --> 00:16:45,734
Oh, no. You can't have it
unless it falls off the shelf.

234
00:16:45,734 --> 00:16:47,594
What?! What's that you say?!

235
00:16:48,234 --> 00:16:51,764
Okay then! Let's all put our powers together!

236
00:16:52,074 --> 00:16:54,704
No need to put anything together!

237
00:17:14,094 --> 00:17:16,794
Why won't that blue one fall off?!

238
00:17:17,134 --> 00:17:19,494
I will not let myself become a gift
for some child to take home!

239
00:17:21,974 --> 00:17:23,024
Uh.

240
00:17:25,804 --> 00:17:27,104
Hurray!

241
00:17:30,744 --> 00:17:32,644
Congratulations!

242
00:17:34,884 --> 00:17:35,904
Huh?

243
00:17:36,554 --> 00:17:39,814
Where did it go? I can't find it.

244
00:17:40,084 --> 00:17:42,124
Huh? It did just fall, didn't it?

245
00:17:42,124 --> 00:17:44,824
Yeah, I know it did!
You all saw it too, didn't you?

246
00:17:56,774 --> 00:18:01,434
Now that was a terrible experience.
If I get this far, I should be okay...!

247
00:18:07,184 --> 00:18:09,014
So you see, that's what happened.

248
00:18:09,284 --> 00:18:14,744
So you've been running around all this time
because the posters got taken down?

249
00:18:15,224 --> 00:18:17,784
Because nobody was coming to the bazaar.

250
00:18:18,324 --> 00:18:20,814
Well it is a pretty small-scale event.

251
00:18:21,264 --> 00:18:23,034
Even if the posters weren't removed,

252
00:18:23,034 --> 00:18:26,554
you shouldn't be expecting too much from
a bazaar held at some kindergarten.

253
00:18:28,504 --> 00:18:30,734
If this is what it was going to come down to,

254
00:18:30,734 --> 00:18:34,434
perhaps I shouldn't have suggested
the bazaar in the first place.

255
00:18:35,344 --> 00:18:40,174
I don't think so. What's important is that
once you decide to do it, you do it.

256
00:18:40,514 --> 00:18:43,144
Even if you encounter obstacles,
you mustn't give up.

257
00:18:45,324 --> 00:18:46,384
Yes.

258
00:18:46,384 --> 00:18:50,414
Even if you get drenched in water
or shot at by snipers.

259
00:18:50,654 --> 00:18:51,664
Yes?

260
00:18:51,664 --> 00:18:53,094
Oh never mind.

261
00:18:53,524 --> 00:18:56,024
Anyway, the important thing is to see it through.

262
00:18:56,364 --> 00:18:58,594
Don't get discouraged because
you don't have customers.

263
00:18:59,834 --> 00:19:01,464
Yomogi Kindergarten
Bazaar Hall

264
00:19:12,584 --> 00:19:14,044
Kobato! You're back!

265
00:19:14,044 --> 00:19:15,344
You're late!

266
00:19:15,714 --> 00:19:18,184
Look, look at how much we sold!

267
00:19:18,384 --> 00:19:20,324
The weather dolls sold too!

268
00:19:20,524 --> 00:19:25,284
Thanks to you, Kobato, I found a good deal.

269
00:19:33,404 --> 00:19:35,404
How long do you plan to just stand there?

270
00:19:35,404 --> 00:19:37,874
Huh? I-I'm sorry!

271
00:19:38,244 --> 00:19:41,174
Look at the number of guests. We need help.

272
00:19:43,474 --> 00:19:46,674
So get busy and help us out.

273
00:19:49,084 --> 00:19:50,104
Yes!

274
00:19:50,314 --> 00:19:51,414
Kobato?

275
00:19:52,424 --> 00:19:58,024
Thank you so much. If it weren't for you, we
wouldn't have had so many people here today.

276
00:19:58,024 --> 00:19:59,724
Oh! But I...!

277
00:19:59,724 --> 00:20:00,924
Look.

278
00:20:03,264 --> 00:20:05,564
See how much fun everyone is having?

279
00:20:06,604 --> 00:20:08,124
It's all because of you.

280
00:20:10,934 --> 00:20:12,044
Hi Kobato.

281
00:20:12,044 --> 00:20:16,134
Domoto! Thank you for taking the time to come!

282
00:20:16,674 --> 00:20:20,134
You're very welcome. I had a wonderful time.

283
00:20:20,944 --> 00:20:22,384
I'm so glad!

284
00:20:22,514 --> 00:20:27,454
But I would have had a better time if you
handed me my purchases directly.

285
00:20:27,784 --> 00:20:32,724
Oh that's right! I brought some things
I made too. I wonder if they sold.

286
00:20:32,794 --> 00:20:34,724
500 yen each

287
00:20:34,994 --> 00:20:37,934
Nobody bought any.

288
00:20:38,204 --> 00:20:41,234
Well I'm not surprised. Who's going
to want this mysterious life form?

289
00:20:41,234 --> 00:20:46,264
You can't even tell if it's a chicken
or a penguin or a sheep.

290
00:20:47,104 --> 00:20:48,514
Then I'll buy it.

291
00:20:48,514 --> 00:20:50,534
What? Really?

292
00:20:52,644 --> 00:20:54,274
Thank you very much!

293
00:20:54,684 --> 00:20:57,044
It's very unique.

294
00:20:57,454 --> 00:20:58,854
You have an interesting sense of art.

295
00:20:58,854 --> 00:20:59,884
What?

296
00:20:59,884 --> 00:21:02,824
Mmm... a rabbit?

297
00:21:03,894 --> 00:21:06,294
D-Domoto!

298
00:21:07,724 --> 00:21:08,594
Huh?

299
00:21:15,804 --> 00:21:18,444
Today was a lovely day.

300
00:21:18,444 --> 00:21:20,064
I had a horrible day.

301
00:21:20,174 --> 00:21:21,444
Is that so?

302
00:21:21,444 --> 00:21:24,904
Yes that is so! Weren't you listening to me?!

303
00:21:25,344 --> 00:21:28,684
Umm... Is that so?

304
00:21:28,684 --> 00:21:30,374
And your response is still, "is that so?"

305
00:21:30,814 --> 00:21:35,694
Oh well, at least I saved my special
something. All's well that ends well.

306
00:21:35,694 --> 00:21:37,794
As soon as I get home, I am going to indulge!

307
00:21:37,794 --> 00:21:41,164
No, I'm going to slowly enjoy every
bite of my special something!

308
00:21:41,334 --> 00:21:42,264
Special something?

309
00:21:42,264 --> 00:21:43,364
You know!

310
00:21:43,364 --> 00:21:45,494
What do I know?

311
00:21:45,704 --> 00:21:46,594
Huh?

312
00:21:47,704 --> 00:21:49,634
My very special baumkuchen cake! It's gone!

313
00:21:49,634 --> 00:21:52,674
Oh well, I guess we'll just have to go
back to the kindergarten to get it.

314
00:21:52,674 --> 00:21:55,934
Oh, the baumkuchen. That sold immediately.

315
00:21:56,074 --> 00:21:57,044
Huh?

316
00:21:57,574 --> 00:22:00,874
Wha, wha, wha... What did you do that for?!

317
00:22:01,184 --> 00:22:04,724
Ioryogi-san, the " something that
will surely sell" you said.

318
00:22:04,724 --> 00:22:08,554
That baumkuchen cake was that
something, wasn't it?

319
00:22:12,494 --> 00:22:15,014
Thank you so much!

320
00:22:16,164 --> 00:22:21,364
Today's points... 80 for your enthusiasm
in putting on the bazaar, and...

321
00:22:23,374 --> 00:22:27,444
Add to that my disappointment
and the total is minus 300!

322
00:22:27,444 --> 00:22:29,844
WHAT?!

323
00:22:30,344 --> 00:22:35,584
But why?! I don't understand! Why is it my fault
that you're disappointed?! If it is, I apologize!

324
00:22:35,584 --> 00:22:37,484
No apology can help in this case!

325
00:22:37,484 --> 00:22:42,924
Th-Then! I'll give you this cute rabbit that I
especially made so you can feel better!

326
00:22:42,924 --> 00:22:43,794
I don't want it!

327
00:22:43,794 --> 00:22:46,494
Th-Then as a bonus I'll give you two!

328
00:22:46,494 --> 00:22:47,964
I'm telling you, I don't want it!

329
00:22:47,964 --> 00:22:51,024
Then you can also have this
adorable bear and this sheep.

330
00:22:51,094 --> 00:22:55,274
In the first place, I've got no idea what any of
them are! They're all mysterious life forms!

331
00:22:55,274 --> 00:22:58,534
Hey! That's not nice, Ioryogi-san!

332
00:23:01,374 --> 00:23:09,014
Everyone dreams of flying

333
00:23:10,184 --> 00:23:16,284
But they let gravity trick them

334
00:23:16,554 --> 00:23:24,394
Honestly, everyone is already able to fly

335
00:23:26,634 --> 00:23:32,974
I bet the reason that child looks so terribly sad

336
00:23:34,004 --> 00:23:36,874
Is because he

337
00:23:36,874 --> 00:23:44,014
Accidentally lost his shadow somewhere

338
00:23:44,184 --> 00:23:46,714
In that case

339
00:23:46,884 --> 00:23:50,994
If I could just tell you, "Thank you,"

340
00:23:50,994 --> 00:23:54,864
And you laugh and reply, "Thank you"

341
00:23:54,864 --> 00:24:02,204
That exchange would fill you with joy

342
00:24:02,734 --> 00:24:06,974
It would make you feel so happy

343
00:24:07,274 --> 00:24:11,514
There's nothing to worry about

344
00:24:11,514 --> 00:24:15,604
Since we're together

345
00:24:17,384 --> 00:24:23,324
It's strange how I'm crying

346
00:24:23,324 --> 00:24:26,094
Even though I'm happy

347
00:24:26,094 --> 00:24:29,064
Next episode
...Warmth of the Wintry Wind.
Even though I'm happy

348
00:24:29,064 --> 00:24:30,794
Next episode
...Warmth of the Wintry Wind.

